 <h3><u>Roab abbas ki ankho mein hai haider jaisa</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Roab abbas ki ankho'n mein hai haider jaisa<br> Aankh bhar kar jise dekha hua patthar jaisa</p> 
  <p>Roab abbas ki aankho'n mein hai haider jaisa</p> 
  <p>1. Kehke ye haath alamdaar ne khud rok liya<br> hurmala tere liye kaafi hai asghar jaisa</p> 
  <p>2. Teri saqqayi ka ejaaz hai abbas e ali<br> paani milta hai, paani milta hai sabilo pe bhi kausar jaisa</p> 
  <p>3. Kaun maidaa'n mein hai siffeen ke ghazi ya ali<br> kashmakash mein hai khada malik e ashtar jaisa</p> 
  <p>4. Koi kamzarf use bhi na khuda kehde kahi'n<br> hu bahu chehra e abbas hai haider jaisa</p> 
  <p>5. Ungliyo'n par hi utha leta wo kaandhe ki jagah<br> mashk ka wazn jo hota dare khaibar jaisa</p> 
  <p>6. Ambiya bol uthe dekhke abbas ka noor<br> sirf haider hi bana sakta hai haider jaisa</p> 
  <p>7. Lashkar e sharr pe nazar daalke ghazi ne kaha<br> Haal hoga fir'aun ke lashkar jaisa</p> 
  <p>8. Lauh e mehfuz ke bhi bas mein nahi hurr ki qasam<br> likhte hai hazrat e abbas muqaddar jaisa</p> 
  <p>9. Hai habib ibn e mazahir ko likhe khat ka karam<br> likhta hai midhat e shabbir jo akbar jaisa</p> 
  <p>Abbas, abbas, abbas, abbas</p> 
